- Fixed fleetd losing a BitLocker recovery key it rotated on a Windows host when fleetd restarted before Fleet received the key. Fleet kept the previous key, which no longer unlocked the disk, and showed the host's disk encryption as verified. Fleetd now rotates the key again the next time Fleet asks it to restore protection or encrypt. With Fleet 4.93.0 or later, fleetd also reports the lost key so Fleet asks for a new one.
